   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "1. Upload each model's image (from 'Character creation', or any full-body photo) and name them. Model 1 goes on the LEFT of the picture, Model 2 on the RIGHT.\n2. Optionally describe each model in a few words (helps keep clothes and body apart).\n3. Describe the action and the camera angle.\n4. Optional: to copy the action from a reference photo, right-click the green 'Action reference' group > Bypass Group Nodes (turns it on), and load the photo.\n5. Queue. Saved as outputs/comfyui/scenes/<Name1>_<Name2>_00001_.png\n\nIf a face looks off, it is usually turned away or covered: try another seed."
